        { "type": "textarea", "id": "text", "label": "Text", "default": "Beta-sitosterol and delta-7-sterine, the plant sterols in pumpkin seed oil, help inhibit 5-alpha-reductase so less testosterone becomes follicle-shrinking DHT." },
